{"id":"n62746-3-9","stage":2,"title":"대중 · 大众","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62746-3-9-1","ko":"주말엔 보통 뭐하세요?","zh":"周末你一般都做些什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주말엔","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말엔","audio":"/audio/cdf8c6c1a366c6b03005.mp3"}},{"text":"보통","meaning":"普通，一般","explanation":"보통：普通，一般","readings":[{"term":"보통","audio":"/audio/666599febd987f532ea6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65572","senseId":"1","lemma":"보통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보통","audio":"/audio/666599febd987f532ea6.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐하세요?","meaning":"什么；做，干","explanation":"뭐：什么；하다：做，干；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐하세요","audio":"/audio/a290ff9d5a3475c632db.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"666599febd987f53","term":"보통","zh":"普通，一般","audio":"/audio/666599febd987f532ea6.mp3","entryId":"65572","definition":"一般性地；或指通常。","pronunciation":["보ː통"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f15