69eb37bd53.mp3"}},{"text":"보내요.","meaning":"度过","explanation":"보내다：度过；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"7","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보내요","audio":"/audio/0ba6af28ecc23da016d4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"随便","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"没有任何想法或别意地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"84d97b13b15d5c17","term":"만화","zh":"漫画","audio":"/audio/84d97b13b15d5c175a7f.mp3","entryId":"53033","definition":"把人的人生、社会或者想象中的故事有趣地表现出来的画；或指由那种画编制的书。","pronunciation":["만ː화"]},{"id":"bed14e1a1e7b1386","term":"대중","zh":"大众，通俗","audio":"/audio/bed14e1a1e7b1386ef24.mp3","entryId":"62746","definition":"指供许多人使用和享受的，价格便宜或合乎许多人喜好的平凡事物。","pronunciation":["대ː중"]},{"id":"d6064de0a4717871","term":"잡지","zh":"杂志","audio":"/audio/d6064de0a471787155ef.mp3","entryId":"62518","definition":"定期发行的书，有各种内容的新闻、照片、广告等。","pronunciation":["잡찌"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"阅读，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"读书籍、报纸、地图中的字、图、符号等而理解内容。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间，空儿","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"做某事的空闲。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"让时间流逝。","pronunciation":["보내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/67b33f9520929d7b4422.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.807,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62746","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":66,"sequenceScore":1.6337,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我就看看漫画或通俗杂志来打发时间。","年薪是多少？","周末你一般都做些什么？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我就看看漫画或通俗杂志来打发时间。","